<!--
  ats_invalid_ruc_format.xml — IdInformante is a 10-digit RUC without the "001"
  branch suffix.

  Rule exercised: numeroRucType, ats.xsd:6-15. Two facets reject it: pattern
  "[0-9]{10}001" at ats.xsd:11 and length 13 at ats.xsd:12.

  Element under test: iva/IdInformante, ats.xsd:597.
  The accepted shape is 10 digits followed by the literal "001": the RUC of the
  company itself, never a supplier RUC and never a 13-digit foreign supplier
  identifier. The same 10+001 shape is deliberately NOT applied to
  detalleCompras/idProv, which uses idProvType (ats.xsd:564-574,
  "[0-9a-zA-Z]{3,13}") and accepts foreign suppliers with 3 to 13 alphanumerics.
-->
